<title>ESTONIA: HANSA MOST ACTIVE BROKER ON BOURSE.</title>
<headline>HANSA MOST ACTIVE BROKER ON BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansapank made 34 percent of total deals made on Tallinn stock exchange in April compared to 25 percent in March, the bourse said on Monday.</p>
<p>Hoiupank accounted for 15 percent, Uhispank 12 percent and Forekspank nine percent of deals made on the bourse, it added in a statement.</p>
<p>Stock exchange turnover was 1.478 million kroons in April.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom, +372 630 8400, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
